In the figure, each pair of consecutive sides forms a right angle.  What is the area of the figure?

[asy]
draw((6,0)--(13.5,0));
label("9''",(9.75,0),S);
draw((6,0)--(6,3));
label("4''",(6,1.5),W);
draw((6,3)--(0,3));
label("8''",(3,3),S);
draw((0,3)--(0,9));
label("7''",(0,6),W);
draw((0,9)--(9,9));
label("12''",(4.5,9),N);
draw((9,9)--(9,6.75));
label("3''",(9,7.625),E);
draw((9,6.75)--(13.5,6.75));
draw((13.5,6.75)--(13.5,0));
[/asy]

